      "content": "The drivers are starting to push back hard on these new shift patterns. They're claiming the turnaround times are impossible and it's causing fatigue. We can't have this blowing up into a strike right now. I need you to draft a formal justification for these schedules that we can send to the union reps. It needs to frame the current shifts as being optimized for both maximum efficiency and strict adherence to all safety and rest-period regulations. Make it sound airtight.",
